NOTICE — GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 3-bit on TensorFold (2x DGX Spark)

This repository contains original patch scripts, a custom CUDA kernel, and packaging tools
by greatyingzi (https://github.com/greatyingzi, https://x.com/greatYiTin), licensed Apache-2.0.

Upstream works this project derives from / depends on:

1. TensorFold (https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold), Apache-2.0.
   The patch scripts modify files inside the TensorFold 0.6.0 Python package
   (families/glm5_next/cuda/*, cuda/exl3/*) at Docker build time. The patched files are
   marked in-place by the scripts (anchors "tf-v7", "tf-v12", "EXL3_ALLOWED_BITS", etc.).

2. Mia's AI Lab GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks serving kit
   (https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks), Apache-2.0.
   The base container image used by the Dockerfile comes from this kit's recipe
   (TensorFold v0.6.0 build). We are not affiliated with MiaAI-Lab or the TensorFold author.

3. The quantized model this project serves:
   https://huggingface.co/androidli/GLM-5.3-Flash-Uncensored-EXL3-3.0bpw-mcg-TensorFold
   (MIT, base: dealignai/GLM-5.3-Flash-UNCENSORED-FP8 <- zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash).

No weights are redistributed in this repository.
